WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.200
The Nabataean people were indeed geniuses,

2
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:06.000
pioneering innovations
that far surpassed their era.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.600
These once-nomadic people
settled in AlUla

4
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.600
and were masters of stone carving
and water engineering.
